text:
Found and fixed the issue. The `s_circle_timer` and `s_orbit_timer` LVGL timers were not being deleted when `xiaozhi_voice_delete()` was called. These timers would continue firing even after the objects they update were deleted, causing the page to freeze when switching to another app.

**Fix applied:** Added timer deletion in `xiaozhi_voice_delete()`:
```c
/* 停止圆环进度条和轨道动画定时器 */
if (s_circle_timer != NULL)
  {
    lv_timer_del(s_circle_timer);
    s_circle_timer = NULL;
  }
if (s_orbit_timer != NULL)
  {
    lv_timer_del(s_orbit_timer);
    s_orbit_timer = NULL;
  }
```

All LVGL timers are now properly cleaned up when the xiaozhi_voice app exits.

