  // Wait for any pending deferred delete to complete
  while (s_deferred_delete_timer != NULL) {
    usleep(1000);
  }

  if (xiaozhi_container != NULL) {
    lv_obj_clear_flag(xiaozhi_container, LV_OBJ_FLAG_HIDDEN);
    return;
  }
  // ... create new UI ...
}
```

Actually, this creates a problem—if `xiaozhi_voice_start` is called from a different thread than `lv_timer_handler`, the deferred timer won't fire while we're sleeping, causing a deadlock. Better to just accept the minor glitch and let the timer complete naturally. I'll leave `xiaozhi_voice_start` as is and focus on verifying the overall implementation is solid.

